msgid "In the inbox, your organization's name and address appear instead of \"WordPress <wordpress@…>\". Emails that expect a reply are sent from the bilgi@ address; emails that don't, such as passwords and notifications, are sent from the no-reply@ address. You can choose which one to use for each email separately."
